<title>NICARAGUA: Nicaraguan thieves leave victims shoeless.</title>
<headline>Nicaraguan thieves leave victims shoeless.</headline>
<dateline>MANAGUA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four armed men intercepted a truck with 25 peasants on board in central Nicaragua and stole their shoes, a local newspaper reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>The gunmen then shot out the truck's tires, forcing the victims to walk barefoot for help, the newspaper, La Prensa, said.</p>
